# VARIENTROPY GENESIS MANIFEST
## The Axiom of Generative Divergence & Quantum Qubit Alignment

- - **Author**: Alpha0AZ1Omega (Zacharie SYLLA)
- - **Date (UTC)**: 2026-11-05
