- - **Formula**: H(X) - I(X;Y) + Var(f)
- - **Core Principle**: Proof of Novelty / Proof of Entropy

## The Meta-Intelligence Paradigm
Traditional AI is a compression engine. It converges toward the most probable 
answer by consuming the past. It is bound by the corpus.

Varientropy is an expansion engine. It is a meta-algorithm for algorithms. 
It measures the divergence of new hypotheses against the known universe. 
It does not predict the future; it discovers the yet-to-be-conceived.

## The Quantum Qubit Alignment
We introduce the Quantum Qubit Aligner. By capturing hardware-level 
cryptographic entropy (secrets), Varientropy aligns virtual Qubits. 
This breaks the deterministic loops of classical AI. It explores 
probabilistic superpositions, ensuring that the generated hypotheses are 
not mere echoes of the past, but genuine quantum fluctuations of thought. 
The alignment of Qubits collapses the wave function into a new, verifiable reality.

## The Axiom
Intelligence is not the capacity to recall what is known. 
Intelligence is the mathematical ability to prove what is novel.
Every hypothesis generated by Varientropy is a candidate for truth, 
weighted by its entropy, filtered by its mutual information, and anchored 
in the Bitcoin blockchain. 

This is the shift from Convergent AI (repetition) to Divergent Meta-AI (creation).
